BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:byron-thpp94@dothings
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260920
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260921
SUMMARY:Colours of Time
DESCRIPTION:Brought together by the unexpected inheritance of an abandoned 
 house in rural Normandy\, four cousins discover they share a mysterious fa
 mily history. In 1895\, their ancestor Adèle\, then aged 21\, leaves her 
 hometown to search for her mother in Paris. She discovers a city on the cu
 sp of modernity\, bustling with new-found avant-garde creativity\, with th
 e rise of photography and the birth of Impressionist painting. As her desc
 endants retrace her steps\, they unravel Adèle’s surprising past. The t
 wo timelines of 1895 and 2024 intertwine and collide\, confronting the cou
 sins’ contemporary attitudes with life in late 19th century Paris\, leav
 ing everyone’s future forever changed.
LOCATION:Star Court Theatre
URL:http://starcourttheatre.com.au/events/timecolours
END:VEVENT
